  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Deduction Research Transaction Set (891) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set can be used by a seller to request information about a deduction from an invoice. It can also be used by a seller's agent or buyer to provide complete details needed to resolve deduction amounts.",
